objc2-link-presentation: LinkPresentation is macOS 10.15+, there is none on PowerPC.
Don't link LinkPresentation.framework on PowerPC, so that a program that merely
has this crate in its dependency graph still links. Its classes are
looked up at run time (and not found); a C function or static from
LinkPresentation that is actually used is still undefined at link time.

--- a/src/generated/mod.rs
+++ b/src/generated/mod.rs
@@ -15,3 +15,7 @@
 
-#[link(name = "LinkPresentation", kind = "framework")]
+// LinkPresentation is macOS 10.15+, there is none on PowerPC.
+#[cfg_attr(
+    not(any(target_arch = "powerpc", target_arch = "powerpc64")),
+    link(name = "LinkPresentation", kind = "framework")
+)]
 extern "C" {}
